# Patterns are matched against the build context root, so every nested-path
# rule needs a **/ prefix to cover apps/* and packages/* too.

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.swc
**/.wrangler
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Secrets — never bake env files, keys or certificates into an image.
# Pass build-time values with `docker build --secret` (see Dockerfile).
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.npmrc
.vercel
**/.vercel

# VCS / CI / editor
.git
.github
.husky
.idea
.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/.DS_Store

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*

# Docker files themselves
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
